    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "むかし、むかし、あるところに――\r\nおじいさんとおばあさんが……おりました。",
            "enText": "A long, long time ago… there lived an old man \nand an old woman.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 764694659035544522,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "おばあさんが川へ洗濯に行くと……\r\n川上から……ドン……ブラコ……ドン……。",
            "enText": "One day, the woman went down to the river \nto do the washing… But then, from the river…\n<i>Slish, swosh… slish…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -3586441539151354059,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "ひゃっ……！？",
            "enText": "<i>Eek…!?</i>",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 6830491905187306040,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "こ、これって普通の昔話……だよね？\r\nなんだか知ってる雰囲気と違う気が……。",
            "enText": "Th-This is just some normal folk tale, right? \nThe atmosphere you're creating seems\nkind of… off…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 7408293062817439762,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゼンノロブロイ",
            "enName": "Zenno Rob Roy",
            "jpText": "かか、語り口が独特だからでしょうか？\r\n特に『ドンブラコ』の部分とか……！",
            "enText": "S-S-Surely it's her unique way of speaking. \nEspecially on the swoshing sounds…!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 7954983328913427903,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……『ドンブラコ』の表現、難しいです。\r\n実際に聞いたことがないので……。",
            "enText": "It's harder than it seems. I've never actually\nheard the sound, after all…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -6765376776785922178,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "あっ、それならわかるよ！\r\n『ドンブラコ～ドンブラコ～』\nって、揺れながら流れてくるイメージだね！",
            "enText": "Ah, that's understandable! There's a certain \nmuckiness to <i>slish, swosh</i>, isn't there!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -2423844843034989723,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……え？　うん……確かにそうだね。",
            "enText": "…Hm? Yes… I would agree.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 7834499485382177016,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゼンノロブロイ",
            "enName": "Zenno Rob Roy",
            "jpText": "えーっと……カフェさん？",
            "enText": "Um… Cafe?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 5586105015775201212,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……気にしないでください。\r\n『ライスさんのドンブラコがかわいい』\nという意見に同意していただけです……。",
            "enText": "…Pay it no mind. I was just agreeing \nthat Rice's \"slish swosh\" sounded \nreally cute.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -8825270220917793378,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……ここに『お友だち』が来ているので。",
            "enText": "My friend is here with us, you see…",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -762866625858866582,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "2人",
            "enName": "Both",
            "jpText": "…………！？！？",
            "enText": "……!?!?",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": -7806900792619169305,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
